  "flavor_text_entries": [
    {
      "flavor_text": "やまを　くらい　けずり　ビルを\nのみこむ　すがたが　ほうこく　された。\nウルトラビーストの　いっしゅ。",
      "language": {
        "name": "ja-hrkt",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/1/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "sun",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/27/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "산을 깎아 먹고 빌딩을\n삼키는 모습이 보고되었다.\n울트라비스트 중 하나이다.",
      "language": {
        "name": "ko",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/3/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "sun",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/27/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "報告指出有人見過牠\n削山吞樓的模樣。\n是究極異獸的一種。",
      "language": {
        "name": "zh-hant",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/4/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "sun",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/27/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Une espèce d’Ultra-Chimère.\nOn l’aurait aperçue dévorant des montagnes\net des gratte-ciel.",
      "language": {
        "name": "fr",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/5/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "sun",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/27/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Eine Ultrabestie, die einigen Berichten zufolge\nganze Berge vertilgt und selbst mehrstöckige\nGebäude verschlingen kann.",
      "language": {
        "name": "de",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/6/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "sun",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/27/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Se dice que este Ultraente ha sido avistado\ndevorando montañas enteras y tragándose\nprominentes edificios.",
      "language": {
        "name": "es",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/7/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "sun",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/27/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Stando alle testimonianze, è in grado di divorare\nintere montagne e di inghiottire edifici in un solo\nboccone. È una delle Ultracreature.",
      "language": {
        "name": "it",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/8/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "sun",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/27/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "It has gobbled mountains and swallowed whole\nbuildings, according to reports. It’s one of the\nUltra Beasts.",
      "language": {
        "name": "en",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/9/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "sun",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/27/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "山を　喰らい　削り　ビルを\n飲みこむ　姿が　報告　された。\nウルトラビーストの　一種。",
      "language": {
        "name": "ja",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/11/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "sun",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/27/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "有人报告过它啃噬山体，\n以及吞掉大楼的模样。\n是究极异兽的一种。",
      "language": {
        "name": "zh-hans",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/12/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "sun",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/27/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Se dice que este Ultraente ha sido avistado\ndevorando montañas enteras y tragándose\nprominentes edificios.",
      "language": {
        "name": "es-419",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/14/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "sun",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/27/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "きけんせいぶつ　ビーストの　いっしゅ。\nつねに　なにかを　くらっているようだが\nなぜか　フンは　みはっけん。",
      "language": {
        "name": "ja-hrkt",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/1/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "moon",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/28/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "위험생물 비스트의 일종.\n항상 무언가를 먹고 있는 듯하지만\n왜인지 배설물은 발견되지 않았다.",
      "language": {
        "name": "ko",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/3/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "moon",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/28/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "危險生物，是究極異獸的一種。\n好像一直都在吃著什麼，\n但不知為何從未發現過糞便。",
      "language": {
        "name": "zh-hant",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/4/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "moon",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/28/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "L’une des dangereuses Ultra-Chimères.\nElle est constamment en train de manger,\nmais ne semble pas produire d’excréments.",
      "language": {
        "name": "fr",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/5/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "moon",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/28/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Eine gefährliche Ultrabestie, die ununterbrochen\nmit Fressen beschäftigt zu sein scheint.\nEs wurden jedoch nie Exkremente gefunden.",
      "language": {
        "name": "de",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/6/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "moon",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/28/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Un Ultraente extremadamente peligroso. Engulle\ntodo lo que encuentra, pero, por alguna razón,\nno se han encontrado excrementos suyos.",
      "language": {
        "name": "es",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/7/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "moon",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/28/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "È una delle pericolose Ultracreature.\nMangia continuamente, ma per qualche strano\nmotivo non produce escrementi.",
      "language": {
        "name": "it",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/8/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "moon",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/28/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "A dangerous Ultra Beast, it appears to be eating\nconstantly, but for some reason its droppings\nhave never been found.",
      "language": {
        "name": "en",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/9/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "moon",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/28/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "危険生物　ビーストの　一種。\nつねに　なにかを　喰らっているようだが\nなぜか　フンは　未発見。",
      "language": {
        "name": "ja",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/11/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "moon",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/28/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "危险生物，究极异兽的一种。\n好像一直都在吃着什么，\n但不知为何从没发现过粪便。",
      "language": {
        "name": "zh-hans",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/12/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "moon",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/28/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Un Ultraente extremadamente peligroso. Engulle\ntodo lo que encuentra, pero, por alguna razón,\nno se han encontrado excrementos suyos.",
      "language": {
        "name": "es-419",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/14/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "moon",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/28/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "このせかいでは　いしつで　きけんだが\nほんらい　すんでいる　せかいでは\nふつうに　みかける　せいぶつらしい。",
      "language": {
        "name": "ja-hrkt",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/1/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "ultra-sun",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/29/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "이 세계와는 성질이 다르고\n위험하지만 원래 살던 세계에서는\n흔히 볼 수 있는 생물인 듯하다.",
      "language": {
        "name": "ko",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/3/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "ultra-sun",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/29/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "在這個世界是危險的異類，\n但在原本棲息的世界裡，\n牠似乎是常見的普通生物。",
      "language": {
        "name": "zh-hant",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/4/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "ultra-sun",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/29/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Cette créature venue d’ailleurs est dangereuse\ndans notre monde, mais il semblerait qu’elle soit\ntrès commune dans le sien.",
      "language": {
        "name": "fr",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/5/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "ultra-sun",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/29/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "In dieser Welt wirkt sein Aussehen gefährlich\nund fremdartig, doch in seiner ursprünglichen\nWelt ist es ein ganz gewöhnliches Lebewesen.",
      "language": {
        "name": "de",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/6/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "ultra-sun",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/29/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Para los seres de este mundo resulta extraño\ny peligroso, pero en el mundo del que procede\nes una criatura muy común.",
      "language": {
        "name": "es",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/7/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "ultra-sun",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/29/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Nel nostro mondo il suo aspetto appare strano\ne minaccioso, ma sembra che in quello da cui\nproviene sia una creatura molto comune.",
      "language": {
        "name": "it",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/8/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "ultra-sun",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/29/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Although it’s alien to this world and a danger\nhere, it’s apparently a common organism in the\nworld where it normally lives.",
      "language": {
        "name": "en",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/9/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "ultra-sun",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/29/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "この世界では　異質で　危険だが\n本来　棲んでいる　世界では\n普通に　見かける　生物らしい。",
      "language": {
        "name": "ja",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/11/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "ultra-sun",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/29/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "在这个世界是异类，很危险，\n但在它原本栖息的世界，\n好像只是寻常能见的生物。",
      "language": {
        "name": "zh-hans",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/12/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "ultra-sun",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/29/"
